  "estimatedMinutes": 60,
  "summary": "How to keep a business running after a disaster and how to move workloads into AWS. Covers RPO and RTO, the four DR strategies from backup and restore to multi-site active/active, Elastic Disaster Recovery, AWS Backup with Vault Lock, DMS with SCT and Multi-AZ, Aurora migration paths, server rehosting with Application Migration Service (now AWS Transform MGN), discovery tools, VMware options and how to size large data transfers.",
